+2.  **InclusiveSum:** Parallel Gaussian-level processing to compute prefix sums for tile assignment [S1].
+3.  **DuplicateWithKeys:** Parallel Gaussian-level processing to duplicate Gaussian entries for each tile they cover [S1].
+4.  **SortPairs:** Gaussian-Tile pair parallel sorting by tile index and depth [S1].
+5.  **IdentifyTileRanges:** Gaussian-Tile pair parallel range identification to determine start/end indices per tile [S1].
 6.  **Render:** Pixel-level parallel rendering with serial alpha blending within tiles [S1].
 
